OL,3,GNEWSADisqualified driver jailed after
OL,4,Apolice chase ends 'crime spree'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA disqualified driver has been jailed
OL,7,Ffor a "crime spree" spate of offences,
OL,8,Fincluding stealing two cars, five jars
OL,9,Fof coffee, and two bottles of whiskey.
OL,11,FAn investigation by South Wales Police
OL,12,Ffound Liam McDonald, 35, of no fixed
OL,13,Fabode, committed several crimes in and
OL,14,Faround Cardiff across three weeks in
OL,15,FJuly.
OL,17,FHe previously pleaded guilty to
OL,18,Fnumerous offences, including two counts
OL,19,Fof driving while disqualified,
OL,20,Faggravated vehicle taking and dangerous
OL,21,Fdriving, and using a vehicle without
OL,22,Fthird-party insurance.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
