OL,3,GNEWSADisqualified driver jailed after
OL,4,Apolice chase ends 'crime spree'
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Friday, McDonald was sentenced to a
OL,7,Fyear and nine months at Cardiff Crown
OL,8,FCourt. He was also banned from driving
OL,9,Ffor three years.
